Hikari wo mitsuketa

00:23:02.353 --> 00:23:06.915
Mezamete iku sora ni

00:23:07.091 --> 00:23:12.529
Anata ga kagayaku no

00:23:12.696 --> 00:23:17.599
Donna ni tooku

00:23:17.735 --> 00:23:22.695
Hanarete ite mo

00:23:22.873 --> 00:23:27.708
Onnaji yoake wo

00:23:27.845 --> 00:23:33.249
Mukaete iru no ne

00:23:33.384 --> 00:23:38.014
Mabushiku kirameku no

00:23:38.155 --> 00:23:43.457
Omoide wo musubu ito

